#. Over 5 minutes limit modal title
msgid "overLimitModalTitle"
msgstr "The video is too long to process in your device"

# Since Screenity is completely private and runs locally, it's limited by your device's hardware. Processing a video of this length would take too long, and be very resource intensive. Don't worry, you can still download the WEBM file or the raw recording, but editing and MP4 export are not available. That said, you can still try to process the video anyway, if you understand the risks.
#
# 由于Screenity完全私密且在本地运行，它受到您设备硬件的限制。处理这样长度的视频需要很长时间，而且资源消耗很大。但您仍然可以下载WEBM文件或原始录制文件，但无法进行编辑和MP4导出。尽管如此，如果您了解风险，仍然可以尝试处理该视频。
#. Over 5 minutes limit modal description
msgid "overLimitModalDescription"
msgstr ""
"Since Screenity is completely private and runs locally, it's limited by "
"your device's hardware. Processing a video of this length would take too "
"long, and be very resource intensive. Don't worry, you can still download "
"the WEBM file or the raw recording, but editing and MP4 export are not "
"available. That said, you can still try to process the video anyway, if you "
"understand the risks."

